Nurse Mouth was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the same 3/7 for 5G as its Undertale counterpart [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Big_Mouth Big Mouth]. '''Beta 40.0''' dropped both their HP to 6.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP:
* 7 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 6 (Post Beta 40.0, Current)
Cost: 5

Ability: Restore 3 HP to you if an ally => 3G monster dies.

Rarity: Blue (Rare)

=== Trivia ===
* Upon its release, its effect was bugged and actually healed you from the death of ally monsters that costed equal or LESS than 3G, not equal or MORE.
* Beta 50.0 updated its image, making it the much more on par with Big Mouth's sprite.
